        "slug": "engineer-drone-orders",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>On each of the Engineer's turns the drone makes <strong>one Shock Strike</strong> at a target the Engineer chooses, without costing the Engineer an action. With Combat Drone Upgrade it makes two, the second with the usual −5 multiple attack penalty. Moving it is part of directing it, and is free.</p>"
